 one team defending a light castle and the other a dark one, separated by a ravine. Each team occupies a gate tower equipped with a magic ballista and the ability to hurl bombs to defend against any threats nearing their gate. Additionally, players can deploy three types of minions (siege, ranged, melee) to walk across the single bridge to attack the enemy’s gate. The goal is to breach the opposing team’s gate first, combining strategy, accuracy, and teamwork to achieve victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365420/extras/3eb1817efb4214aadf781382e0570066.poster.avif?t=1755685053\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365420/extras/3eb1817efb4214aadf781382e0570066.webm?t=1755685053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365420/extras/568879d326e7517079d740784632a709.avif?t=1755685053\" width=699 height=251 /></span></h2></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mode: 1-4 Player Arcade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players enter a peaceful Japanese dojo and garden, transformed into an archery shooting gallery. Equipped with bows, players aim to hit a variety of targets, including special bonus targets, that appear across the range. The game combines precision, speed, and accuracy as players compete to achieve the highest score. The calm aesthetics of the dojo add to the immersive experience, making each round both challenging and serene.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>   </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365420/extras/f6436ec74df4ab3e76177fb473c46ab0.avif?t=1